 f"{sum(n>0 for n in newinputs.values())}/{len(newinputs)} distinct nominated identities solve at least one fresh individual input beyond the union of all protected references. These counts differ from complete paired skills and both-pose ordinary bases. See detailed rows below; inherited capabilities do not count as M15 acquisitions.",'',
 '## Design and interpretation limits','',
