 'Control uses12protected+8merit,coverage,finite-panel genotype-neutral reserve and lexicase. Explore keeps12protected+8merit,then up to12representatives of distinct eligible quality vectors; these replace existing survivor capacity. Optimal4,valid3,selected emitted partial routes1/2; empty/allzero/false-no-path profiles ineligible. No full-parent-retention requirement for explorer eligibility. First12mutant births cycle explorers when available; remaining33shared lexicase. Thus this is a joint survival/breeding policy package, not isolated causality of either component. Distinct finite-panel profiles are not proven route precursors or global semantic novelty.','',
 'Both arms see identical inputs withinpair:48fresh rotating+48fixed ordinary training inputs; exact M11 BANK development panels,392assessment inputs,115nominal assessment slots including nonselectable A0padding. Banks were conditioned on parent success; they are development data. Repeated exposures are not independent evidence. Historical M11 bank construction12742parentcalls is additional prior cost. Equal nominal evaluations are not equal CPU.','',
 'Registered bounds: 1024 additional rounds maximum, assessments every16 cumulative rounds,4200s soft/5400s hard search,100M calls/1e15 work,ten workers,8GiB RSS,8GiB total phase including backups,16GiB disk floor. Separate final900s/1M calls/1e14 work and3600s per audit.','',
